--
-- GENERATED by the script named at the end of this file — edit that, re-run
-- it, do not hand-patch this.
--
-- Forty-seven inverter chargers carried between 0 and 26 keys each: most
-- held only rated_output_power_w and a battery voltage, seven held nothing at
-- all, and one (SNV-GH30081) held a full transcription. Off-grid and hybrid
-- units share one field set — a hybrid is an off-grid inverter that can also
-- export, and the grid block reading null on an off-grid unit is itself the
-- answer to "can this export?".
--
-- Every inverter_charger row ends up with the same 44 keys. A value the
-- datasheet does not state is null, which a query can count; a MISSING key
-- cannot be counted, and that is the whole point of a declared field set.

